(2) Nits: README.md:712 and 720 are not re-wrapped (115 and 97 columns); hermes_test.go:335 subtest name "leading and trailing --" means '---'.
Also found (drift, not this card, worth a ticket): internal/config/config.go decodeYAML (~715) decodes only the first document of unreagent.yaml / unreagent.local.yaml, without a word — the silent loss k118 fixes for the rewrite, now at load (the k118 local.yaml test fixture's second document is ignored at load). fileExists (~750) uses os.Stat, so a looping or dangling unreagent.local.yaml is skipped at load without a warning.
That Hermes refuses multi-document files is the card's claim, unverified.

